WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.030
<i>I wished that time would stop.</i>

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.670
<i>A moment where I felt happy, 
which would last an eternity.</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.240
<i>Where you wouldn't have to fight,</i>

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.570
<i>and it wouldn't matter how many 
times you repeated it.</i>

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.070
<i>Because it was important to me.</i>

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.730
<i>Because I wanted to protect it.</i>

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.710
<i>There wasn't anything special about it.</i>

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:37.680
<i>I just wanted these ordinary 
days to last forever.</i>

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>But...</i>

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:44.980
Shirou, why are you...

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.390
Why do you always destroy everything?

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:56.110
I don't know...

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:01.040
I've just always liked doing 
the opposite of you.

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:03.700
I don't know why myself.

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:06.450
Damn it.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.420
The déjà vu won't stop...

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.440
It's hilarious.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.220
I've been through this before.

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:52.090
Okay, thank you for everything.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:53.040
<b>Discharge Form
Fujii Ren</b>

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.650
Take care.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.170
<b></b>

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.170
<b>Twilight Girl</b>

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.020
Not waiting for the girl who always comes to see you?

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.950
No, she's at school today,

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:03.030
and she can be loud, so I'll leave now.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.050
How cold.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:07.100
If you do that, she'll start to hate you.

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:09.570
Well, I'll be careful.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.530
Um, Fujii-kun...

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:15.340
I'm really sorry about what 
happened with Yusa-kun.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.090
Don't worry about it.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.470
He ran away on his own.

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:25.180
It's always that dumb idiot's fault.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.920
It's that season again, huh?

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.500
Christmas...

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.530
What did I do last year?

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.820
In the end, time keeps flowing, huh?

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:48.250
Of course it does. How stupid.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.590
Ren! Ren!

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:53.610
You can hear me, can't you?

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.710
Hey! Look at me!

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.010
Don't ignore me!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.380
Ren, that's you, isn't it?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.800
Look at me!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.470
You! Fujii Ren!

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:06.090
Answer me, damn it!

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.570
Ow!

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.150
Ow...

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.490
What are you doing?

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.390
That's my line.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.540
Why are you ignoring me?

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:24.740
Anyone would, the way you 
were screaming my name.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.980
Kasumi, are you okay?

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:28.520
Yeah, thanks.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:35.010
Anyway, why did you leave without me?

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:37.700
Did you forget I said I'd come get you?

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.530
I don't know...

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.210
This is your problem!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.670
You got hurt and were suddenly hospitalized.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:48.300
I was so worried, I visited you every day,

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.890
but you left without telling me,

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:54.040
and started wandering around out here.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.330
Who do you think you are?

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.100
Are you serious? You really want to do this?

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.190
Do you want to fight?!

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.100
Fine...

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.870
I'm totally at fault.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.410
I'm sorry, so give me a break.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.070
I don't know...

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.010
What do you want me to do?

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.630
In that case, come to this with me.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.210
I got some tickets.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.880
<b>Swords of the World Exhibition</b>

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:20.880
The Swords of the World Exhibition.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:25.800
<b>Swords of the World Exhibition</b>

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.260
This is amazing!

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:34.450
Some swords really do look like 
video game weapons, huh?

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.620
How romantic...

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.430
Hey, Ren, don't you think so?

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:43.730
What's wrong? You look pale...

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:47.600
Did you forget that I don't like this stuff?

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:48.950
You don't?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.820
But isn't that a little silly?

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:53.600
They won't jump at you or anything.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.630
So why don't you like blades?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:57.540
I don't know why...

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.650
No reason...

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:04.250
It's just, you know...

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:05.610
Really?

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.900
Then, use this to overcome it!

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.910
It's a problem for you, right?

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.430
You can't even hold a kitchen knife.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.260
Boys need to be able to cook these days!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:16.850
Fine... Don't pull at me!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.570
Huh?

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.540
What's wrong? Did something happen?

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.320
No...

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:40.460
Hey, what's wrong?

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.680
What is this? A guillotine?

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.010
What's this doing here?

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:03.210
Sure, it has a blade,

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.770
but it isn't what this show is about.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.400
Let's go.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.860
This is kind of scary.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:12.070
Yeah.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.280
You... the same...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.630
Become the same... as me.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.220
I've been waiting.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.440
Um, I'm sorry.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:49.500
I should have known better, 
with you just out of the hospital.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:53.780
Anyone would get sick if they're surrounded
 by things they hate, right?

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:57.270
It's fine. I'm the one who 
caused problems for you.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:59.380
I didn't think I would pass out.

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.040
I'm really embarrassed.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.870
Are you okay?

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.520
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:05.970
No need to worry.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.050
Then tomorrow, it's back to school!

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:11.380
I'll be bby in the morning.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.850
That's fine, Kasumi, but...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:29.820
<b>Remember to Knock!!</b>

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:26.380
Leave through the front door!

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:29.820
But it's a pain!

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.530
This hole leads to my room.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.360
And that hole leads to Shirou's room.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.450
It makes it easier for us to help each other.

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:42.630
Wasn't helping each other like this 
the condition for living alone?

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:43.980
It's fine, isn't it?

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.180
It isn't fine!

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:48.750
No way did our parents think 
we'd be doing this!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:53.140
Anyway, Shirou's gone—

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.050
That isn't true!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:57.550
I believe he'll come back.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.430
So don't seal that hole.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:05.540
He won't come back.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:17.120
Get out of here, Kasu-dummy!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.030
Where am I?

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.650
<i>Blood, blood, blood.</i>

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.390
<i>It wants blood.</i>

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:26.750
<i>Offer the blood to the guillotine.</i>

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:39.240
<i>Blood to quench the guillotine's thirst.</i>

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:48.510
<i>What it wants is blood, blood, blood.</i>

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:53.020
We meet again, Cagliostro.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.930
<i>Blood, blood, blood.</i>

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.950
<i>It wants blood.</i>

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:06.010
<i>Offer the blood to the guillotine.</i>

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:15.440
<i>Blood to quench the guillotine's thirst.</i>

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:22.280
<i>What it wants is blood, blood, blood!</i>

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.410
What was that?

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.730
What happened?

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:35.120
Sorry.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.300
You just started yelling...

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.970
Did you have a nightmare?

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.070
A dream?

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.260
What's going on?

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:45.860
Has there been some kind of crime?

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:53.770
Hey, did you hear? There was a murder!

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:58.690
Yeah, the one where the 
guy's head was cut off?

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:01.530
Seriously? How did you hear that?

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.180
It's just a rumor,

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:06.320
but the first one to find the 
body was a student here.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.690
Ren, where are you going?

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.020
What about lunch?

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.790
Sorry, I just don't have any appetite.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.860
You eat mine.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:20.570
Huh? Are you kidding me?

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.720
<b>Congrats on being discharged. 
School was lonely without you. 

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:31.060
<b>By the way, there's no one else here. 

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.270
<b>Just the two of us!!?</b>

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.270
<b>
Banzai!!</b>

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.580
Sometimes, I don't know about her...

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.070
Senpai...

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:49.410
I'm cold.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.120
I'm frozen. Warm me up.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:57.420
Fujii-kun, if you lent me that, I'd be happy.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.840
Actually, just give it to me, dummy.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.010
I'm warm now.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.270
You're a gentleman, Fujii-kun.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.400
As thanks, would you like this?

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:16.480
It's a kimchee-umeboshi sandwich.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.830
The taste is quite challenging.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:21.230
I'll pass.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:24.530
So, what did you want?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.590
Well, it isn't that important.

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:29.500
First, congratulations on being discharged,

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:32.680
and I'm sorry about what 
happened with Yusa-kun.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.140
You were so close.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.160
Why are you making that face?

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.420
Like you don't even care.

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:43.550
It's true that you were friends, isn't it?

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:47.840
But he dropped out, and I don't know 
where he is or what he's doing.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:48.950
He's an idiot.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.630
I know how you feel,

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:53.190
but saying that isn't good.

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:57.000
You two can't get away from each other 
that easily. You'll meet again.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.810
And when that happens, 
you need to make up.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.440
Both Ayase-san and I are worried.

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:08.910
Do you want Riza to lecture you?

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.580
That's practically her job, 
so I'm sure it will work.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:12.660
Riza?

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.530
Isn't that...

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:16.620
Yes, Sister Riza.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:21.080
Blue eyes and giant, F-cup boobs.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.960
By the way, I'm a B-cup.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.420
Maybe one day, I'll get bigger.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:29.390
What's with those eyes?

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:30.960
Oh, it's nothing...

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.940
So is this F-cup girl doing well?

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:37.690
Yes... I'd like to say, but the 
fact is that I'm not sure.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:41.100
She saw a murder.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.120
Honestly, I'm not handling it well, either.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:49.990
I know why the police would 
kept me up all night, questioning me,

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:52.120
but still...

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:53.990
It's kind of scary.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:55.870
It would make anyone lose their appetite.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.990
You mean you saw the body?

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:01.900
Yeah. No head and plenty of spurting blood.

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:05.780
Anyway,

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:10.630
I wanted to say that it's dangerous 
there, so let's both be careful.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.790
<i>Hey, where did you go?!</i>

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:18.360
<i>Did you forget you have a class to get to?</i>

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.480
We do?

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.600
<i>We do!</i>

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:21.600
<b>Ayase Kasumi</b>

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.450
<i>You were absent while you were hospitalized.</i>

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:28.110
<b>Ayase Kasumi</b>

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.570
<i>If you miss any more school, you'll be held back!</i>

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:27.900
<i>Do you want that?</i>

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:28.660
<i>You do?</i>

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:32.210
<i>You want me to graduate by myself?!</i>

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.320
Oh, no. You dummy...

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.620
You can't do that. I won't be 
able to control my voice.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.730
<i>Hey! What the hell are you doing?!</i>

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:43.140
Oh, no. Not so suddenly, Fujii-kun.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.460
If you do it to me, I'll... Aah!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.870
<i>Senpai, that's you, right?</i>

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.070
<b>Ayase Kasumi</b>

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:49.410
<i>Ren, it's the middle of the day—</i>

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:53.570
Oh, no, you brute. How awful, pervert.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:54.510
Senpai?

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.490
But... But if you do that to me,

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:59.180
I'll go crazy...

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.180
Listen to me, crazy girl.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:01.020
Who's crazy?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:07.420
I'm trying to be a seductive, older girl, 
who's teasing a younger student.

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:09.860
It doesn't suit you at all.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:11.490
Jeez...

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:14.210
Class is starting. Aren't you going?

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.870
If I go now, Kasumi will kill me.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.170
I'll skip.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:20.790
I see. Thanks for this, then.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.530
Hey, now...

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.930
What am I doing?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.000
Kasumi.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:08.920
You are just...

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:11.500
Let's go.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.630
I said I was sorry.

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:25.090
You shouldn't be doing club activities
 this late at night, anyway.

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:27.900
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.130
I can use my bamboo sword
 to take down a murderer!

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:33.900
You're saying that again?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.090
Senpai?

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:40.030
You're right.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.370
Who's she with?

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:43.260
No idea.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:44.830
She's coming this way.

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:59.220
Hey, Rea-senpai! What are you doing?

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.190
Nothing.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.480
Did you know her?

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:08.260
No, she just asked for directions.

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:11.520
It's nothing... Really.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.460
You've been at school all this time?

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.300
That's right.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.190
I've been busy taking care of him.

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:19.350
That's my line, Kasu-dummy.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.280
What?!

00:18:21.590 --> 00:18:24.020
<i>That's right. It's nothing.</i>

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.950
<i>My daily life doesn't change.</i>

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.880
Let's go, senpai.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:36.330
<i>I wanted to believe that, 
even without Shirou,</i>

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.570
<i>nothing about my daily life had changed.</i>

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.370
It's here.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.950
Welcome to Shambhala.

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:41.690
Welcome, Sturmscharführer Marie 
and Obersturmführer Bey. {D: TC - this was "Marius" but maybe supposed to be Marie? Neither Marius nor Bey is on the naming list}

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:42.910
It has been a long time.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:46.150
Yeah, it certainly has, Father.

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:47.580
Enough talk...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:51.140
Who's inside Shambhala now?

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:53.650
Leonhart, Sonnenkind,

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:55.190
Babylon, and Tubal Cain.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:58.090
In other words, Spinne is the 
only one missing now.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.910
Leonhart?

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.590
The missing Valkyrie.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.690
Has that girl gotten any better at it?

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:08.670
You may see for yourself.

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:11.680
For the sake of Lord Heydrich, {D: TC - this was "Heidrich" but I assume it's not a new character? Double check}

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:15.400
the vice commander has prepared this unit...

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:19.980
And the Ars Magna we have desired is upon us.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:28.250
No evil, no sins, no chains will bind you,

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.380
and all taboos are meaningless.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:35.320
Your god, your lord,
 will lead you to this land.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:37.690
You will take sword in hand,

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:40.420
and destroy all of your lord's foes.

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:43.930
Leave not a single one alive.

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.640
Everyone, offer up the holy...

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:51.310
Kill the men. Kill the women.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:54.020
Kill the old. Kill the babies.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.850
Kill the dogs. Kill the horses and cattle.

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.320
Kill the camels. Kill the goats.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.530
God will allow it, as shall I.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.490
Your lord will allow all.

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.950
You are a knight, the claws 
and fangs of a beast.

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:11.650
Wilhelm Ehrenburg.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:14.610
Rusalka Maria Schwägerin.

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:18.760
In the name of the third rank of the Longinus 
Dreizehn Orden black round table,

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:23.460
Valeria Trifa blesses you.

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:27.820
Grant us victory.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>The Claws and Fangs of a Beast</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:41.250
<b>Illustration: Riichu</b>
